                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I had some doubts when going into this game when spectating the category of uniqueness. After getting the game, though, I was not disappointed in the slightest. The story as well as the idea of a second self mirroring your actions was presented in an orignal way, and composed the story-telling in a way that keeps the player engaged until the end. \n\nIt may because I played it so much, but the game seemed a bit short, and left me wanting to play more (obviously, I still play the game often). My favourite part, though, was the absolutely beautiful colours and music. The colours and music throughout all of the seasons were unbelieveably fantastic. \n\nOverall a great game!",
